ind":"announcement","title":"1453 demo: recorded gameplay each evening","summary":"A recorded run through the opening of the free 1453 demo plays here in the evenings (18:00–24:00 CET/CEST) during Steam Next Fest. It is not live, so a question in chat may wait a while. The demo is free on this page.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:54:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690069","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004180-1846651706686499","game_id":"steam-5004180","kind":"announcement","title":"The 1453 demo is playable now: the Janissary's first four chapters","summary":"The demo is open The free demo of 1453: Fall of Constantinople is playable on Steam, starting today, and the game is part of Steam Next Fest until 26 October. It is later than our first post said. In August we named 8 October; we held the demo back so it would open with Next Fest, when the most people are looking. You were born Greek and taken as a boy. Now you are camped outside the city your grandmother prayed toward, close enough to count the stones in its wall. What the demo holds The Janiss","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:16:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004180-1844115010501681","game_id":"steam-5004180","kind":"announcement","title":"1453: Fall of Constantinople releases October 28","summary":"1453: Fall of Constantinople releases on 28 October. Constantinople, 1453. Four witnesses — a janissary, a baker's daughter, an engineer, a noble — live the same fifty-three days of the siege. The choices you make cross between their stories, and the city remembers them. It is an illustrated, choice-driven historical novel where every ending is someone's truth. Neither side's ending is the right one. It launches in thirteen languages: English, Greek, Turkish, French, German, Spanish (Spain and L","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T15:16:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004180-1842212951311059","game_id":"steam-5004180","kind":"announcement","title":"Italian is in the game — and a discussion thread is why","summary":"When this page went up, Italian was not on the language list. On 10 August a player opened a discussion called LINGUA ITALIANA / ITALIAN LANGUAGE. Every comment on it was a +1. Italian is now in 1453: Fall of Constantinople. It ships with the full release on 28 October, and it brings the game to thirteen languages — English, Greek, Turkish, Italian, French, German, Spanish (Spain and Latin America), Japanese, Korean, Portuguese-Brazil, Russian and Simplified Chinese. We are saying this out loud ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T17:52:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004180-1839676055894258","game_id":"steam-5004180","kind":"announcement","title":"1453 is in Steam Next Fest — the demo opens October 8","summary":"Four people are going to live through the same fifty-three days, and none of them will agree about what happened. 1453: Fall of Constantinople will be part of Steam Next Fest, October 19-26, and the playable demo goes live earlier than that — October 8, when the fest's Press Preview opens. If you are new here: this is a choice-driven historical novel told by four witnesses on both sides of the wall. A janissary who was born Greek and taken in the devşirme. A baker's daughter keeping a bread queu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T09:15:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894258","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5004180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5004180":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5004180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z"},"5037720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:17Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5004180","app_id":5004180,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:16Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2f4a5741aba5ec2ac19b769f506f7ad4841a1c731ce28bed57856a6546d4f6a0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"1500년 베네치아. 안나 노타라스가 콘스탄티노폴리스 함락에 관한 네 개의 증언을 받아 적습니다. 증인은 예니체리, 빵집 딸, 기술자, 귀족. 네 사람은 저마다 4월 6일부터 5월 29일까지 이어진 포위의 같은 53일을 성벽의 이쪽 또는 저쪽에서 살아갑니다. 한 증인이 한 일은 다른 증인들이 할 수 있는 일을 바꿉니다. 각 장이 끝나면 그 장면이 목격자의 일기에서 왔는지, 후대의 연대기나 전설에서 왔는지를 보여 주는 선택형 삽화 역사 소설입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"3Cats Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46217660}],"developers":[{"name":"3Cats Studio"